--- !u!114 &114808096326136206
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1551191919794309}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 318
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 只见古神教护法高举戮仙剑，斩向身后的巨大石壁。猎猎破空声后巨大的轰鸣骤然响起，一股奇异的空间波动扩散至整个大殿。
