--- !u!114 &114035358804372069
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1551191919794309}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 299
  indentLevel: 0
  storyText: 不得已之下，恒如只得调动更多的飞尘进行防御，周围的其它众人见此情形，也一起加紧了攻势。那恒如真人双拳难敌四手，很快便呈出落败的迹象。
  description:
  AvatarIDSetType: 1
  AvatarID: {fileID: 0}
  AvatarIntID: 0
